WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:09.401
"Wizard!" The king's face was red.

2
00:00:09.402 --> 00:00:12.258
"Do something!"

3
00:00:12.259 --> 00:00:21.408
"I'll look for a spell!" Tom said.

4
00:00:21.409 --> 00:00:24.002
Tom ran past the Royal Kitchen.

5
00:00:24.003 --> 00:00:27.580
"Tom! Help!" Cook cried.

6
00:00:27.581 --> 00:00:30.394
"All our food has disappeared.

7
00:00:30.395 --> 00:00:32.928
There is nothing to eat!"

8
00:00:32.929 --> 00:00:44.159
Then Tom heard screams from outside.

9
00:00:44.160 --> 00:00:49.404
He hurried to the Royal Stables.

10
00:00:49.405 --> 00:00:56.113
All the horses were running around the yard.

11
00:00:56.114 --> 00:01:01.975
The tiger was chasing them!

12
00:01:01.976 --> 00:01:06.146
"Help, Tom!" the stable boy cried.

13
00:01:06.147 --> 00:01:10.124
"Do something, Wizard!" Dirk shouted.

14
00:01:10.125 --> 00:01:15.810
"I'll try!" Tom called.

15
00:01:15.811 --> 00:01:19.283
He raced to the royal grandmother's room.

16
00:01:19.284 --> 00:01:22.280
He knocked hard on her door.

17
00:01:22.281 --> 00:01:27.322
"Your Majesty? May I come in?"

18
00:01:27.323 --> 00:01:32.595
A servant opened the door.

19
00:01:32.596 --> 00:01:35.316
Tom blinked in surprise.

20
00:01:35.317 --> 00:01:38.713
The royal grandmother sat on the king's throne.

21
00:01:38.714 --> 00:01:42.337
On a table was a huge feast.

22
00:01:42.338 --> 00:01:45.770
The royal grandmother waved happily at Tom.

23
00:01:45.771 --> 00:01:48.903
"Wizard!" she cried.

24
00:01:48.904 --> 00:01:51.556
"The wishing cap is wonderful!

25
00:01:51.557 --> 00:01:54.660
All my wishes came true!"

26
00:01:54.661 --> 00:01:58.873
Tom gulped. "Yes, Your Majesty, but . . .

27
00:01:58.874 --> 00:02:02.242
Your wishes have made everyone else unhappy."

28
00:02:02.243 --> 00:02:06.377
"What?" said the royal grandmother.

29
00:02:06.378 --> 00:02:10.128
"The king has no throne," Tom went on.

30
00:02:10.129 --> 00:02:12.433
"There's nothing to eat.

31
00:02:12.434 --> 00:02:15.483
And your tiger is scaring the horses.

32
00:02:15.484 --> 00:02:18.064
Please undo your wishes!"

33
00:02:18.065 --> 00:02:20.442
The royal grandmother frowned.

34
00:02:20.443 --> 00:02:22.764
She folded her arms.

35
00:02:22.765 --> 00:02:25.304
"Too bad!" she said.

36
00:02:25.305 --> 00:02:34.394
"I will not undo my wishes!"

